# Run artifacts NEVER belong in git: full stream-json traces, whole-workdir snapshots,
# provenance, metrics, and anything an agent (full tools + web) might have written — which
# could include a secret it fetched. Everything the harness produces lands under runs/.
runs/
*.jsonl
!/dev/null

# Any stray credentials / env files (defense in depth — nothing here should ever write one).
.env
*.envrc
.mcp.json
